  "description": "Erection of additional storey involving mansard roof, with front and rear dormers.\r\r",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "The proposed additional storey, by reason of its design, height, siting and excessive bulk, would appear visually intrusive, incongruous and overly dominant, and it would fail to respect the character and significance of the adjoining non designated heritage asset. There are no public benefits that would outweigh the identified harm. The proposal is therefore contrary to Sections 12 and 16 of the National Planning Policy Framework (2024), Policies D4 and HC1 of the London Plan (2021), Policies CP30 and CP31 of the Enfield Core Strategy (2010), and Policies DMD37 and DMD44 of the Enfield Development Management Document (2014)."
